{"4476150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Island Fever", "steam_appid": 4476150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island Fever is a sandbox survival game set in a procedurally generated archipelago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world in Island Fever isn't very spacious, and the islands are separated by the sea, that can't be traversed without a raft and food supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with nothing but pebbles and crude tools, slowly working your way toward faster and more sophisticated equipment that will allow you to transform your island into a thriving fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cartoony pixel-art style contrasts with a semi-realistic (but simple) survival system focused on resource gathering, food, and progress.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and expand your fortress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure the harsh weather</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of overwhelming you with endless mechanics, the game gradually introduces new tools and possibilities until you finally conquer the islands.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island Fever is a sandbox survival game set in a procedurally generated archipelago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world in Island Fever isn't very spacious, and the islands are separated by the sea, that can't be traversed without a raft and food supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with nothing but pebbles and crude tools, slowly working your way toward faster and more sophisticated equipment that will allow you to transform your island into a thriving fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cartoony pixel-art style contrasts with a semi-realistic (but simple) survival system focused on resource gathering, food, and progress.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and expand your fortress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure the harsh weather</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of overwhelming you with endless mechanics, the game gradually introduces new tools and possibilities until you finally conquer the islands.</p>", "short_description": "Stranded, forgotten and isolated. That's the fate of our protagonist in Island Fever who tries to survive in the harsh conditions of this resource-scarce place. Monsters, weather, hunger and much more are out to get you. Build, adapt, survive — or become another lost soul swallowed by the island.", "supported_languages": "English, Polish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476150/f659ecc56808c50eb4c92aefbc8ba3de9b99681b/header.jpg?t=1773437131", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476150/892da23a10e76c95b3387824e8c492a5fcf1f4f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773437131", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476150/892da23a10e76c95b3387824e8c492a5fcf1f4f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773437131", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Bartłomiej Sapalski"], "publishers": ["Bartłomiej Sapalski"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 47, "description": "LAN PvP"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"},